{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>想找一款不依賴網絡、把食譜牢牢留在自己裝置的烹飪工具嗎？《Debra's Offline Kitchen》正是為此而設，適合經常在家下廚、外出露營、行船或身處網絡不穩環境的人士。所有食譜直接儲存於裝置，無需帳戶、登入或雲端連線，原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-139.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>完全離線運作的食譜庫</h2>\n<p>App 可儲存並整理最多 1000 份個人食譜，資料直接存放於裝置，無需帳戶、登入或雲端連線。內建購物清單工具讓你從食譜直接建立清單，並在清單下方以視覺化選單呈現，減少反覆捲動。食譜開啟迅速，沒有載入延誤，即使網絡不穩亦能隨時查閱。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-591-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-592-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-593-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-594-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-595-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-596-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Debra's Offline Kitchen</li><li>應用類別：Food &amp; Drink</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/debras-offline-kitchen/id6760205374?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T02:41:32.199045+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":326,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T02:28:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T05:00:30.225910+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T02:38:24.831041+00:00","content_hash":"659f6bd5d5023a80a5b311da84ab2a4d6a3ca9183afe630872477db4f78e9fee","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}